  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:09.053" end="00:11.569" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:11.569" end="00:14.556" ttm:agent="v1">Everything still cool, being me, I can't lose</p>
      <p begin="00:14.556" end="00:16.056" ttm:agent="v1">I know you getting confused</p>
      <p begin="00:15.812" end="00:17.808" ttm:agent="v1">They like, &quot;How you do it so smooth?&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:17.808" end="00:20.815" ttm:agent="v1">Gotta stay in tune, with your love, I can't lose</p>
      <p begin="00:20.815" end="00:24.069" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Stay nine, stay ten, make sure you gon' lose, yeah (We love you, Tecca)</p>
      <p begin="00:24.069" end="00:25.573" ttm:agent="v1">I can see you wanna vibe with me</p>
      <p begin="00:25.573" end="00:27.073" ttm:agent="v1">Just say you wan' vibe with me</p>
      <p begin="00:27.069" end="00:28.812" ttm:agent="v1">Feelin' like I won the lottery</p>
      <p begin="00:28.812" end="00:30.312" ttm:agent="v1">You getting a lot of me</p>
      <p begin="00:30.068" end="00:31.825" ttm:agent="v1">Probably why you callin' me</p>
      <p begin="00:31.825" end="00:36.265" ttm:agent="v1">Is that why you callin' me?</p>
      <p begin="00:36.265" end="00:38.257" ttm:agent="v1">I can see you wanna vibe with me</p>
      <p begin="00:38.257" end="00:39.757" ttm:agent="v1">Just say you wan' vibe with me</p>
      <p begin="00:39.504" end="00:41.272" ttm:agent="v1">Feelin' like I won the lottery</p>
      <p begin="00:41.272" end="00:42.772" ttm:agent="v1">You getting a lot of me</p>
      <p begin="00:42.504" end="00:44.266" ttm:agent="v1">Probably why you callin' me</p>
      <p begin="00:44.266" end="00:45.766" ttm:agent="v1">Is that why you callin' me?</p>
      <p begin="00:45.749" end="00:47.504" ttm:agent="v1">Feelin' like I won the lottery</p>
      <p begin="00:47.504" end="00:49.501" ttm:agent="v1">You getting a lot of me</p>
      <p begin="00:49.501" end="00:52.513" ttm:agent="v1">Mixing different shades up, ballin' like the fall</p>
      <p begin="00:52.513" end="00:55.757" ttm:agent="v1">Trap money, real money, yeah, I want it all</p>
      <p begin="00:55.757" end="00:58.767" ttm:agent="v1">I just take my best feelings, put it in a song</p>
      <p begin="00:58.767" end="01:02.010" ttm:agent="v1">I know I was right, I know you was wrong</p>
      <p begin="01:02.010" end="01:05.009" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I got a vision, let it capture in 4K</p>
      <p begin="01:05.009" end="01:08.251" ttm:agent="v1">We forever young, you won't see me in old age</p>
      <p begin="01:08.251" end="01:11.258" ttm:agent="v1">I'ma do what I want right now, I can't wait 'til it's too late</p>
      <p begin="01:11.258" end="01:14.013" ttm:agent="v1">Everywhere up in the world right now, ten bands in the suitcase</p>
      <p begin="01:14.013" end="01:16.514" ttm:agent="v1">Everything still cool, being me, I can't lose</p>
      <p begin="01:16.514" end="01:18.014" ttm:agent="v1">I know you getting confused</p>
      <p begin="01:18.012" end="01:19.754" ttm:agent="v1">They like, &quot;How you do it so smooth?&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:19.754" end="01:22.766" ttm:agent="v1">Gotta stay in tune, with your love, I can't lose</p>
      <p begin="01:22.766" end="01:26.002" ttm:agent="v1">Stay nine, stay ten, make sure you gon' lose, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:26.002" end="01:27.512" ttm:agent="v1">I can see you wanna vibe with me</p>
      <p begin="01:27.512" end="01:29.013" ttm:agent="v1">Just say you wan' vibe with me</p>
      <p begin="01:29.013" end="01:30.759" ttm:agent="v1">Feelin' like I won the lottery</p>
      <p begin="01:30.759" end="01:32.259" ttm:agent="v1">You getting a lot of me</p>
      <p begin="01:32.021" end="01:33.774" ttm:agent="v1">Probably why you callin' me</p>
      <p begin="01:33.774" end="01:38.203" ttm:agent="v1">Is that why you callin' me?</p>
      <p begin="01:38.203" end="01:40.200" ttm:agent="v1">I can see you wanna vibe with me</p>
      <p begin="01:40.200" end="01:41.700" ttm:agent="v1">Just say you wan' vibe with me</p>
      <p begin="01:41.204" end="01:43.200" ttm:agent="v1">Feelin' like I won the lottery</p>
      <p begin="01:43.200" end="01:44.700" ttm:agent="v1">You getting a lot of me</p>
      <p begin="01:44.453" end="01:46.199" ttm:agent="v1">Probably why you callin' me</p>
      <p begin="01:46.199" end="01:47.699" ttm:agent="v1">Is that why you callin' me?</p>
      <p begin="01:47.466" end="01:49.445" ttm:agent="v1">Feelin' like I won the lottery</p>
      <p begin="01:49.445" end="01:53.445" ttm:agent="v1">You getting a lot of me</p>
    </div>
